end="1:03.070">い</span><span begin="1:03.590" end="1:04.950">合図</span></p><p begin="1:05.480" end="1:11.490" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.480" end="1:06.090">食</span><span begin="1:06.090" end="1:06.400">え</span><span begin="1:06.400" end="1:06.790">な</span><span begin="1:06.870" end="1:07.460">い</span><span begin="1:07.770" end="1:08.560">恋</span><span begin="1:08.560" end="1:08.790">だ</span><span begin="1:08.790" end="1:09.070">と</span><span begin="1:09.490" end="1:10.130">気付</span><span begin="1:10.130" end="1:10.390">い</span><span begin="1:10.390" end="1:10.870">て</span><span begin="1:10.870" end="1:11.490">る</span></p><p begin="1:11.720" end="1:16.880" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.720" end="1:12.120">そ</span><span begin="1:12.120" end="1:12.340">れ</span><span begin="1:12.340" end="1:12.500">な</span><span begin="1:12.500" end="1:12.870">の</span><span begin="1:12.870" end="1:13.130">に</span><span begin="1:13.310" end="1:13.620">蜜</span><span begin="1:13.620" end="1:13.800">の</span><span begin="1:13.800" end="1:14.370">香</span><span begin="1:14.370" end="1:14.480">り</span><span begin="1:14.480" end="1:14.640">に</span><span begin="1:14.810" end="1:15.120">誘</span><span begin="1:15.120" end="1:15.390">わ</span><span begin="1:15.390" end="1:15.590">れ</span><span begin="1:15.590" end="1:15.810">て</span><span begin="1:15.810" end="1:16.360">捕</span><span begin="1:16.360" end="1:16.530">ま</span><span begin="1:16.530" end="1:16.880">る</span></p><p begin="1:16.880" end="1:19.970" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.880" end="1:18.150">私</span><span begin="1:18.150" end="1:18.500">は</span><span begin="1:18.500" end="1:19.970">蝶</span></p><p begin="1:21.610" end="1:29.260" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.610" end="1:22.150">枯</span><span begin="1:22.150" end="1:22.520">れ</span><span begin="1:22.520" end="1:22.990">な</span><span begin="1:22.990" end="1:23.560">い</span><span begin="1:24.020" end="1:24.760